OL,3,GNEWSADiscarded lamp-post flags turned
OL,4,Ainto 'unity' artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge union jack artwork has been
OL,7,Fcreated by repurposing discarded flags
OL,8,Ffrom unauthorised lamp-post displays as
OL,9,Fa message of "unity".
OL,11,FBirmingham textile artist Clare
OL,12,FElisabeth said her work, titled
OL,13,FRe-Union Jack, incorporated dozens of
OL,14,Fworn-out flags and was a response to a
OL,15,Fflag-raising movement that had "caused
OL,16,Fdivision in communities across the
OL,17,Fcountry".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
