OL,3,GNEWSADiscarded lamp-post flags turned
OL,4,Ainto 'unity' artwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe names of hundreds of notable
OL,7,Ffigures from across the West Midlands
OL,8,Fhave been added to the piece, with some
OL,9,Fvisiting the project specifically to
OL,10,Fendorse it by adding their signature.
OL,12,FElisabeth said the work, created as
OL,13,Fpart of the International Day of
OL,14,FBirmingham, celebrated the region's
OL,15,Fheritage as a "magical melting pot".
